Granblue Fantasy: Relink — Vietnamese Localization Patch
========================================================

A fan-made Vietnamese localization for Granblue Fantasy: Relink. Not
affiliated with or endorsed by Cygames, Inc. All game trademarks belong to
their respective owners.

